  "description": "The test attributes and interfaces of DependencyModules: [Mock], [InjectValues], [Shared], [TestExport], and the interfaces for mock libraries and test attributes. It also contains the helpers that find the attributes of a test on the method, the class, and the assembly. It does not depend on a test framework. The DependencyModules.xUnit and DependencyModules.NUnit packages use this package. Add one of those packages to a test project.",
